+Pay teammates and contributors in USDC on Base. Every payout is routed through the
+`Payouts` contract, which forwards the USDC to the recipient and emits a `Paid`
+event carrying the amount and a memo — so the team keeps a shared, onchain record
+of who got paid for what.
 
-🧪 An open-source, up-to-date toolkit for building decentralized applications (dapps) on the Ethereum blockchain. It's designed to make it easier for developers to create and deploy smart contracts and build user interfaces that interact with those contracts.
