-> 🤖 Scaffold-ETH 2 is AI-ready! It has everything agents need to build on Ethereum. Check `.agents/`, `.claude/`, `.opencode` or `.cursor/` for more info.
+## How a payout works
 
-⚙️ Built using NextJS, RainbowKit, Hardhat, Wagmi, Viem, and Typescript.
+1. Connect a wallet and switch to Base.
+2. Enter the recipient (address or ENS), the USDC amount and an optional memo.
+3. Approve the `Payouts` contract for that amount (only shown when the current
+   allowance is too low).
+4. Send the payout. `Payouts.pay` runs `transferFrom` and emits `Paid`.
 
