+The payout feed on `/payouts` reads `Paid` events straight from the chain over a
+rolling two-day window. A full payout history needs an indexer (see the `ponder`
+or `subgraph` skills in `.agents/skills/`) — `getLogs` backfills in batches and
+does not scale to Base's full history.
 
